# is: predicate — value out of range fails assertion.
# Uses inline dict annotation form: @[type: Int  is: [between 1 100]]
# This correctly routes through the is: predicate runtime check (via ReprDecl).
# [@[type: Int  is: [between 1 100]] 0] fails because between 1 100 0 => false
# (subject appended last — subject-last semantics).
[@[type: Int  is: [between 1 100]] 0]
=== error
is: predicate failed
